{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13142","headline":"冬夜集赋得寒漏 · 皇甫冉","name":"冬夜集赋得寒漏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清冬洛阳客，寒漏建章台。\n出禁因风彻，萦窗共月来。\n偏将残濑杂，乍与远鸿哀。\n遥夜重城警，流年滴水催。\n闲斋堪坐听，况有故人杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13142.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13142","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}